{"name":"Boat Blue","hex":"#2d5384","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"boat","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Vessel for travelling by water.\n A small, usually open craft used for travelling over water, propelled by oars, motor or wind. Usually contrasted with \"ship\". .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A small, usually open craft used for travelling over water, propelled by oars, motor or wind. Usually contrasted with \"ship\". .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To travel by boat.","To transport in a boat."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/boat"},{"term":"blue","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a blue hue.","Depressed, melancholic, sad."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The colour of the clear sky or the deep sea; the colour midway between green and violet in the visible spectrum and one of the primary additive colours.","Anything coloured blue, especially to distinguish it from similar objects differing only in colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blue"}],"entries":[{"title":"Boat","blocks":[{"text":"A boat is a watercraft of a large range of types and sizes, but generally smaller than a ship, which is distinguished by its larger size or capacity, its shape, or its ability to carry boats."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Motorboat_at_Kankaria_lake.JPG/330px-Motorboat_at_Kankaria_lake.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boat","wikidata":"Q35872"},{"title":"Blue","blocks":[{"text":"Blue is one of the three primary colours in the RGB (additive) colour model, as well as in the RYB colour model. It lies between violet and cyan on the spectrum of visible light. The term blue generally describes colours perceived by humans observing light with a dominant wavelength between approximately 450 and 495 nanometres. T